Grouped release for `sdk`.

## Breaking changes

### Split the release note renderer

_Packages:_ 🔴 _core_, 🟠 _app_, 🟢 _cli_

_Owner:_ test · _Introduced in:_ [091147d](https://github.com/ifiokjr/monochange/commit/091147d5465db8432fe4ea64df85996dbb5dc795)

One changeset targets three packages with three different change types, so the
group release must publish it once in the breaking section with every affected
package listed.
